{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter Goes on a Blind Date", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Talk to You Later", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Closing Phone Conversations", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "It's important to use expressions to close a phone conversation. You use polite expressions with people you don't know. </br>You can use more informal expressions with your friends or family.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Whenever you are talking on the phone, it can be difficult for a few reasons:  <ol><li>You are not able to see the other person you are speaking with. </li><li>You are not able to see how he or she is reacting to your conversation.</li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Informal Conversation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Polite Conversation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Talk to you soon.</br> I've got to run.</br> Bye.</br> Take care.</br> I'd better get going!\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's been nice talking to you.</br> Good bye.</br> Thank you for calling.</br> I'll talk with you soon.</br> I will call you back ...\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: I've got to run. Talk to you later.</br> <span class=\"strong\">Ted</span>: Sure thing. Take care, man.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About Future Actions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use four different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ul><li>When you talk about things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.</li> <li>When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span>.</li> <li>When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense.</li> <li>When you talk about schedules or timetables in the future, you use the Simple Present tense.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Maybe I'll buy one next time.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm going to charge the battery again.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm expecting a couple of important calls this evening.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The dinner is at 7 tonight.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "smartphone", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a cell phone that connects to the Internet and takes pictures", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My smartphone stopped working!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about cell phones.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "battery ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the part of a device that provides energy", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The battery is almost dead.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "charged", "type": "name"}, {"content": "full of energy", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The battery is fully charged.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "flip phone", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an older model of cell phone that you can flip open", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can talk for hours with my flip phone.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "old school", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not trendy; out of fashion", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's good to be old school sometimes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to die", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to stop working", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My phone keeps dying out of the blue.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Role play 3 different phone conversations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For each conversation, make sure you use expressions to end them properly.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Be sure to be polite and friendly.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles with your partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I role play a telephone conversation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about technology and gadgets.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about what I want to do in the future.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le07ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le07ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Hey Pete. Are you still having trouble with your new phone?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Don't talk to me about that! I'm really upset right now. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: What's going on? Are you still getting that crackling sound?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No, that's fine. The phone just keeps dying out of the blue. I can't do anything about it. The worst part is that I'm expecting a couple of important calls later! The dinner is at 7 tonight."}, {"image": "engenn6le07ob07re2img06.jpg", "time": "20500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Aha, I see. Well, this is what you get when you buy a cool smartphone. They always stop working at some point!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I think you're right. Wait, I've got to run. The battery is almost dead!"}, {"image": "engenn6le07ob07re2img06.jpg", "time": "34500", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Can you talk now? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm not sure anymore! It says battery fully charged but it means nothing to me!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Well, I guess it's good to be old-school sometimes. I'm very happy with my flip phone. I can talk for hours on this thing! </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Maybe I'll buy one next time. Ok, I've got to run. I'm going to charge the battery. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Sure thing. I'll talk to you later! </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Take care, man."}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le07ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le07ob07re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can close phone conversations. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about technology and gadgets.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can say what people are doing now or in the future.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "How do you normally end a phone conversation?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Have people ever just hung up their phone without saying goodbye?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Let's talk about the phone.", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter's phone keeps <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">dying</span>.", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"con